@startuml
actor User
participant FE
participant BE
participant DB

User -> FE : Select file + options

FE -> FE : Generate FEK
FE -> FE : Compute hash
FE -> FE : Encrypt file (AES/ChaCha)

FE -> BE : Request public key
BE -> DB : Fetch public key
DB --> BE
BE --> FE

FE -> FE : Wrap FEK (RSA)

FE -> BE : Upload encrypted data

BE -> DB : Store ciphertext + metadata
DB --> BE

BE --> FE : Success
FE --> User : Uploaded

@enduml